      "fine_trace_step": 12,
      "description": "Error cleanup frees `p->data` but does not clear the field afterwards. The fix adds `p->data = NULL;` immediately after `UA_Array_delete`, so the later `UA_clear` on the same destination no longer reuses a freed array pointer."
