      "fine_trace_step": 14,
      "description": "Second cleanup of the same partially copied DataValue re-enters Variant_clear on a stale `p->data` pointer. The very first read of `p->storageType` comes from the first element of an already freed 192-byte UA_DataValue array, triggering the AddressSanitizer heap-use-after-free READ 4."
